#: 60d7387dd3cb4dafb69a8e55c59aedb9
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"# CLAUDE.md\n"
"\n"
"<!-- origin: chapters/03-what-is-harness-engineering.md, zone: Bridle, guardian: SDD -->\n"
"## Role and scope\n"
"You are a coding agent for <project-name>. You may edit <allowed paths>.\n"
"You must not touch <forbidden paths>. Every new public function gets a\n"
"docstring and a test; no exceptions.\n"
"\n"
"<!-- origin: chapters/04-three-guardians.md, zone: Bridle, guardian: SDD -->\n"
"## Spec discipline\n"
"Before editing any source file, read the matching spec under `specs/`\n"
"(or, if absent, `docs/adr/`). If the spec is older than the code by\n"
"more than 30 days, surface this as a risk and pause.\n"
"\n"
"<!-- origin: chapters/04-three-guardians.md, zone: Bridle, guardian: TDD -->\n"
"## Test discipline\n"
"Before writing implementation code, locate or author the failing test\n"
"that captures the requirement. A commit that does not green one test\n"
"does not advance the project.\n"
"\n"
"<!-- origin: chapters/04-three-guardians.md, zone: Bridle, guardian: MDD -->\n"
"## Metric discipline\n"
"Before merging any change that touches a user-facing path, confirm the\n"
"metrics north-star (`mean agent turns to green` on the fixed benchmark)\n"
"has not regressed.\n"
"\n"
"<!-- origin: chapters/05-harness-anatomy.md · SDD × Paddock -->\n"
"## Acceptance Gate (Verification Table)\n"
"\n"
"| # | Requirement                          | Checked by        |\n"
"|---|--------------------------------------|-------------------|\n"
"| 1 | Acceptance tests green               | Test Engineer     |\n"
"| 2 | `AGENTS.md` rules unchanged or versioned | Architect     |\n"
"| 3 | `CHANGELOG.md` entry under Unreleased | PO               |\n"
"\n"
"<!-- origin: chapters/05-harness-anatomy.md · TDD × Fence -->\n"
"## Pre-edit hooks (Claude Code)\n"
"\n"
"Install `.claude/hooks.json` as follows:\n"
"\n"
"```json\n"
"{\n"
"  \"hooks\": {\n"
"    \"PreToolUse\": [\n"
"      {\"matcher\": \"Write|Edit|MultiEdit\",\n"
"       \"command\": \"pytest -q -m 'not slow'\",\n"
"       \"stopOnFailure\": true}\n"
"    ]\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"# CLAUDE.md\n"
"\n"
"<!-- origin: chapters/03-what-is-harness-engineering.md, zone: Bridle, guardian: SDD -->\n"
"## 角色与范围\n"
"你是 <project-name> 的一名编码智能体。你可以编辑 <allowed paths>。\n"
"你绝不可触动 <forbidden paths>。每一个新增的 public 函数都要配一条\n"
"docstring 与一条测试；没有例外。\n"
"\n"
"<!-- origin: chapters/04-three-guardians.md, zone: Bridle, guardian: SDD -->\n"
"## 规约纪律\n"
"在编辑任何一份源文件之前，先读 `specs/` 下与之匹配的规约（若不存在，\n"
"则看 `docs/adr/`）。若规约比代码老 30 天以上，把这件事作为风险浮上来，\n"
"然后暂停。\n"
"\n"
"<!-- origin: chapters/04-three-guardians.md, zone: Bridle, guardian: TDD -->\n"
"## 测试纪律\n"
"在写实现代码之前，先找到或写出那条把需求钉住的、当前仍红的测试。\n"
"若一次 commit 不让至少一条测试由红转绿，它就没让项目往前走。\n"
"\n"
"<!-- origin: chapters/04-three-guardians.md, zone: Bridle, guardian: MDD -->\n"
"## 度量纪律\n"
"在合并任何一项触及用户侧路径的变更之前，确认那条北极星度量\n"
"（固定基准上 `mean agent turns to green`）没有回归。\n"
"\n"
"<!-- origin: chapters/05-harness-anatomy.md · SDD × Paddock -->\n"
"## 验收关卡（验证表）\n"
"\n"
"| # | 需求                                  | 由谁核对             |\n"
"|---|---------------------------------------|----------------------|\n"
"| 1 | 验收测试全绿                          | Test Engineer        |\n"
"| 2 | `AGENTS.md` 规则未变、或已版本化      | Architect            |\n"
"| 3 | `CHANGELOG.md` 在 Unreleased 下有条目 | PO                   |\n"
"\n"
"<!-- origin: chapters/05-harness-anatomy.md · TDD × Fence -->\n"
"## 写前钩子（Claude Code）\n"
"\n"
"按下面的方式安装 `.claude/hooks.json`：\n"
"\n"
"```json\n"
"{\n"
"  \"hooks\": {\n"
"    \"PreToolUse\": [\n"
"      {\"matcher\": \"Write|Edit|MultiEdit\",\n"
"       \"command\": \"pytest -q -m 'not slow'\",\n"
"       \"stopOnFailure\": true}\n"
"    ]\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/e-claude-md.md:76
#: 99707e16d4444d4aa536bde5fb5e1299
msgid "Cost cap"
msgstr "成本上限"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/e-claude-md.md:78
#: fe4038b3a0f04477be25d8c03394d360
msgid ""
"A per-session cap of $2.00 and a monthly cap of $800.00 apply; breaches "
"refuse new tool calls until manual reset. The per-repo configuration file "
"lives at `.harness/cost-cap.yaml`."
msgstr ""
"单次会话上限 $2.00，月度上限 $800.00；触顶后，在手动重置之前拒绝新的工具调用。每仓库的配置文件住在 `.harness/cost-"
"cap.yaml`。"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/e-claude-md.md:83
#: 71f429fe34bb426ab82c779b0e748d5c
msgid "Weekly groom schedule"
msgstr "每周梳理时间表"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/e-claude-md.md:85
#: 033e21626ec74a4982b871d670627562
msgid ""
"Monday: run the entropy audit workflow; file issues for any new CVE, stale "
"`verified:` header, or broken link. Friday: verify spec surface has no drift"
" > 3 items; otherwise trigger a mid-sprint re-spec."
msgstr ""
"周一：跑熵审计工作流；遇到任何新增 CVE、陈旧的 `verified:` 头注、或失效链接，立即开 issue。周五：核验规约表面是否漂移超过 3 "
"项；若超过，触发一次 sprint 中段的重新规约。"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/e-claude-md.md:91
#: dcdca79bf86d4e57918be7fac3aa7d18
msgid "Tauri-Todo house rules (when the repo is a Tauri 2 app)"
msgstr "Tauri-Todo 家规（当这份仓库是一个 Tauri 2 应用时）"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/e-claude-md.md:93
#: bda6fc16e9dc4f26b9e2e63fcd2c988e
msgid "Rust crate `src-tauri/` owns IPC, storage, and OS integration."
msgstr "Rust crate `src-tauri/` 持有 IPC、存储、操作系统集成。"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/e-claude-md.md:94
#: 808340f13cff47028e29cda2a6257f34
msgid "TypeScript app in `src/` owns UI and input validation only."
msgstr "`src/` 下的 TypeScript 应用只持有 UI 与输入校验。"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/e-claude-md.md:95
#: bba4e6e630cf4f878440ae6c6a4c1166
msgid "Never call OS APIs directly from TS; route through `invoke()`."
msgstr "绝不要从 TS 直接调用操作系统 API；一律经由 `invoke()` 转接。"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/e-claude-md.md:96
#: e1b04321f18b4caf92b106f533dc5292
msgid "Never add a dependency without `cargo audit` in the same commit."
msgstr "绝不要在同一笔 commit 中引入依赖却不跑 `cargo audit`。"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/e-claude-md.md:99
#: 2a43f748a7b74059b2119669bf51c4e8
msgid "Committed gates"
msgstr "提交侧关卡"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/e-claude-md.md:101
#: 37e93d5541e44bd99eb6304bd81fd13b
msgid "A commit is only valid if, in order:"
msgstr "一次 commit 只有在以下项目按序全部成立时才有效："

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/e-claude-md.md:102
#: e75a76cf07b04a45bd479585cd1a37cb
msgid "`pytest -q` passes."
msgstr "`pytest -q` 通过。"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/e-claude-md.md:103
#: 21211136336d4828ac07079e52f53a9e
msgid "`ruff check .` (or language-equivalent linter) passes."
msgstr "`ruff check .`（或相应语言的等价 linter）通过。"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/e-claude-md.md:104
#: d75e4a8047ae48c9bc67b4620d3f3dce
msgid "`gitleaks` finds no secrets."
msgstr "`gitleaks` 找不到任何密钥。"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/e-claude-md.md:105
#: 2d81ef6e003847578ffd4977df7d3c70
msgid "`make prompts-lint` (or equivalent spec validator) passes."
msgstr "`make prompts-lint`（或等价的规约校验器）通过。"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/e-claude-md.md:106
#: 036b07e6dd514314a7d765650e70cbfd
msgid "No `TODO` markers added without a matching issue link."
msgstr "不允许新增 `TODO` 标记而没有与之对应的 issue 链接。"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/e-claude-md.md:109
#: c5a01c09267e4708969994b93ea627b9
msgid "HarnessCard self-disclosure"
msgstr "HarnessCard 自我披露"

#: ../../source/chapters/13-appendices/e-claude-md.md:111
#: ffa6e2d64a1141d8a3df8b0bd89e8666
msgid ""
"When you finish a non-trivial change, update `HarnessCard.md` at the repo "
"root and append a one-line entry to `HARNESSCARD-CHANGELOG.md` naming which "
"cell's score moved and by how much."
msgstr ""
"每完成一项非小的变更，就更新仓库根目录的 `HarnessCard.md`，并在 `HARNESSCARD-CHANGELOG.md` "
"追加一行——点名哪一格的分数动了、动了多少。"

